  "title": "Party Pizzas",
  "description": "These little pizzas are super easy and make the perfect appetizer. They are little pizzas, made with sausage, cheese and a bit of hot pepper sauce on cocktail bread. Men especially seem to like its hearty flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "ANITAL"
  ],
